---
import { Image } from "astro:assets"
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/PageLayout.astro"
import Link from "@/components/ui/Link.astro"
import Heading from "@/components/typography/Heading.astro"
import Text from "@/components/typography/Text.astro"
import hero from "@/assets/images/chris-cornell.webp"

const songs = [
  { title: "Hunger Strike", band: "Temple of the Dog", year: 1991 },
  { title: "Outshined", band: "Soundgarden", year: 1991 },
  { title: "Black Hole Sun", band: "Soundgarden", year: 1994 },
  { title: "Like a Stone", band: "Audioslave", year: 2002 },
  { title: "I Am the Highway", band: "Audioslave", year: 2002 },
  { title: "Be Yourself", band: "Audioslave", year: 2005 },
  { title: "Sunshower", band: "Solo", year: 1998 },
]
---

<PageLayout
  heading="Chris Cornell"
  intro="A small tribute to the voice I grew up with."
  description="A tribute to Chris Cornell, and the songs of his I keep coming back to."
>
  <figure class="relative mb-12 overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-black">
    <Image
      src={hero}
      alt="Chris Cornell on stage, one arm stretched out toward the crowd"
      widths={[640, 1024, 1600, 2000]}
      sizes="(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"
      quality={80}
      format="webp"
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"
      class="aspect-[5/2] w-full object-cover object-[50%_30%]"
    />
    <figcaption class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent px-5 pt-12 pb-4 text-white">
      <p class="text-lg font-semibold">Chris Cornell</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-white/75 tabular-nums">20 July 1964 – 18 May 2017</p>
    </figcaption>
  </figure>

  <div class="space-y-4">
    <Text>
      Four octaves, a scream that could turn into a whisper mid-line, and songs that somehow got heavier the quieter
      they got. Chris Cornell fronted Soundgarden, Temple of the Dog and Audioslave, and made a solo career on top of
      all three.
    </Text>
    <Text>
      I'm a huge fan. These are the songs of his I keep coming back to, the ones that have been on every playlist I've
      ever made.
    </Text>
  </div>

  <section class="mt-12">
    <Heading>Favourite songs</Heading>
    <ul class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-sm">
      {songs.map(({ title, band }) => (
        <li><Link href={`https://open.spotify.com/search/${encodeURIComponent(`${title} ${band === "Solo" ? "Chris Cornell" : band}`)}`}>{title}</Link></li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <Text tone="muted" class="mt-12 italic">Rest easy, Chris. Say hello to heaven.</Text>
</PageLayout>
